      "statement": "SCIM group routes sit under /userconfig/v1/customers/{customerId} and Cloud Browser Isolation routes under /cbiconfig/cbi/api/customers/{customerId}, each a base of its own beside /mgmtconfig.",
      "tier": "A",
      "evidence": [
